{
  "name": "dsh-sound-player",
  "description": "DSH 官方桌面端音效播放器：全部操作集成于设置菜单（设置 → 音效播放器），无悬浮窗。为对话完成、发送消息、权限请求、被提问、服务终止、子代理运行完成、最后一个子代理运行完成等 7 类情况播放提示音；内置合成音效、Windows 系统提示音与 34 个 meme/游戏音效，分「默认 / 神人 / 自定义」三个可编辑音效库并支持导入自己的音频；每条绑定可独立设置音量、播放区间（毫秒级截断）与「渐弱消失」特效，支持试听并中途停止；提供 soundPlayer 服务（window.__dshSoundPlayer__）供其他插件调用。",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "sounds/默认音效库",
    "sounds/神人音效库"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ]
    }
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/LaoQianwocao/dsh-sound-player.git"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
